## Original bug report

```
RPC_ERROR — Odoo Server Error
Model: fleet.vehicle
Timestamp: 2026-06-30 10:26:59 GMT
```

### Root cause

```text
AttributeError: module 'odoo.fields' has no attribute 'first'
```

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Module | `torz/fleet_vehicle_inspection` |
| File | `models/fleet_vehicle.py` |
| Method | `action_view_inspection` (line 44) |
| Broken code | `fields.first(self.inspection_ids).id if self.inspection_ids else False` |

`fields.first()` does not exist in the Odoo API. This is a custom-module defect, not Odoo core.

---

## Fix applied

### Code change

```diff
- fields.first(self.inspection_ids).id if self.inspection_ids else False
+ self.inspection_ids[:1].id if self.inspection_ids else False
```

Uses standard Odoo recordset slicing — returns the first record's id or `False`.

